  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Online Studies Scholarship 2021 Intake (Samoa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Online Studies Scholarship Cohort for the 2021 Intake. The Australia Online Studies Scholarships supports the delivery of distance education within Samoa, facilitating skills development while retaining the student in country particularly where candidates with family and work responsibilities, especially women, wish to continue current employment. Consistent with the goal and objectives of the Australia Awards, the goals of the AOSS is to develop capacity and leadership skills so that individuals can contribute to Samoa&apos;s development and build people-to-people linkages at the individual, institutional and country levels. This investment supports the 2021 intake.</narrative>
  </description>
